"Settings, caches and data of your apps. Look inside it rather than removing it." = "你的 App 的设置、缓存和数据。请查看其中内容，而不要整个移除。";
"Files apps keep so they open and load faster. Apps make them again when needed; quit an app before removing its cache." = "App 为了更快打开和加载而保存的文件。App 会在需要时重新生成；移除缓存前请先退出该 App。";
"One app's cache: files it keeps to load faster. The app makes them again when needed." = "某个 App 的缓存：为加快加载而保存的文件。App 会在需要时重新生成。";
"Records apps and macOS write about what they did. Only useful for tracking down problems." = "App 和 macOS 记录的运行信息。仅在排查问题时有用。";
"Reports written when an app crashed. Only useful for sending to its developer." = "App 崩溃时生成的报告。仅在发送给开发者时有用。";
"Data apps keep for themselves: documents, databases, settings and downloads. Keep the folder; look inside it." = "App 为自己保存的数据：文稿、数据库、设置和下载内容。请保留此文件夹，查看其中内容。";
"Settings and data of one app. Removing it can lose your work in that app; remove it only when the app is gone." = "某个 App 的设置和数据。移除可能会丢失你在该 App 中的工作；仅在该 App 已删除时再移除。";
"Your settings for every app. Small, and removing them resets apps." = "你对每个 App 的设置。占用很小，移除会让 App 恢复默认。";
"Data of apps from the App Store, each in its own sandbox. Remove an app with the Uninstaller instead." = "来自 App Store 的 App 的数据，每个都在各自的沙盒中。请改用卸载器移除 App。";
"Data that apps of one maker share, such as Office or Messages. Removing it can lose data." = "同一开发商的 App 共享的数据，例如 Office 或“信息”。移除可能会丢失数据。";
"Your email and its attachments, kept by Mail. Remove messages or attachments in Mail instead." = "“邮件”保存的电子邮件及附件。请在“邮件”中移除邮件或附件。";
"Your Messages history with its photos and attachments. Remove old conversations in Messages instead." = "“信息”的聊天记录及照片和附件。请在“信息”中移除旧对话。";
"iCloud Drive and the iCloud folders of apps. Removing files here removes them from iCloud too; use Cloud Space to free space." = "iCloud 云盘和 App 的 iCloud 文件夹。在此移除文件也会从 iCloud 移除；请用 Cloud Space 释放空间。";
"Dropbox, OneDrive, Google Drive and other cloud drives. Removing files here removes them from the cloud; use Cloud Space instead." = "Dropbox、OneDrive、Google Drive 等云盘。在此移除文件会从云端移除；请改用 Cloud Space。";
"Your passwords and certificates. Never remove these." = "你的密码和证书。切勿移除。";
"Which windows apps had open, so they can reopen them. Apps start with fresh windows without it." = "App 打开过哪些窗口，以便重新打开。没有它，App 会以新窗口启动。";
"Data of Xcode and other developer tools. Look inside: build data and simulators can often go." = "Xcode 和其他开发工具的数据。请查看其中内容：构建数据和模拟器通常可以移除。";
"Build products and indexes Xcode makes for each project. Xcode builds them again, which takes a while the first time." = "Xcode 为每个项目生成的构建产物和索引。Xcode 会重新生成，第一次会花些时间。";
"Builds you archived to send to the App Store. Keep the ones you may need to read crash reports of." = "你为提交 App Store 而归档的构建。请保留可能需要用来查看崩溃报告的版本。";
"Debug symbols Xcode copied from each iPhone, iPad or Watch you connected. Xcode copies them again when you connect a device." = "Xcode 从你连接过的每台 iPhone、iPad 或 Watch 拷贝的调试符号。连接设备时 Xcode 会再次拷贝。";
"Simulated iPhones and iPads with their apps and data. Xcode can make new ones; remove old ones in Xcode or with xcrun simctl delete unavailable." = "模拟的 iPhone 和 iPad 及其 App 和数据。Xcode 可以新建；请在 Xcode 中或用 xcrun simctl delete unavailable 移除旧的。";
"Backups of your iPhone and iPad. Remove an old one only when you have a newer backup, in Finder or in Space Hunters." = "你的 iPhone 和 iPad 的备份。只有在有更新的备份时，才在访达或 Space Hunters 中移除旧备份。";
"Your Photos library with all your pictures and videos. Never remove it in Finder." = "包含你所有照片和视频的照片图库。切勿在访达中移除。";
"Docker's virtual disk with your images, containers and volumes. Free space with docker system prune or in Docker's settings." = "Docker 的虚拟磁盘，包含你的镜像、容器和卷。请用 docker system prune 或在 Docker 设置中释放空间。";
"The search index Spotlight keeps for apps. macOS builds it again." = "聚焦为 App 保存的搜索索引。macOS 会重新生成。";
"Your Safari history, bookmarks and reading list. Clear history in Safari instead." = "Safari 的历史记录、书签和阅读列表。请在 Safari 中清除历史记录。";
"A browser's profile: bookmarks, history, passwords and extensions. Clear browsing data in the browser instead." = "浏览器的配置文件：书签、历史记录、密码和扩展。请在浏览器中清除浏览数据。";
"Downloads and temporary files an app keeps for itself. It downloads them again; you may need to wait a moment." = "App 为自己保存的下载内容和临时文件。它会重新下载；可能需要稍等片刻。";
"Settings, extensions and open windows of your code editor. Keep it." = "代码编辑器的设置、扩展和打开的窗口。请保留。";
"Your games and their downloads. Uninstall games in their launcher." = "你的游戏及其下载内容。请在启动器中卸载游戏。";
"Downloads a package manager keeps so it can install again without the network. It downloads them again when needed." = "包管理器为离线重新安装而保存的下载内容。需要时会重新下载。";
"Downloaded libraries and build caches of a developer tool. They come back on the next build, which takes longer." = "开发工具下载的库和构建缓存。下次构建时会重新生成，但耗时更长。";
"Installed developer tools and their versions. Removing it uninstalls them." = "已安装的开发工具及其版本。移除即卸载它们。";
"Caches of command-line tools. They make them again when needed." = "命令行工具的缓存。需要时会重新生成。";
"Things you moved to the Trash. Empty the Trash to get the space back." = "你移到废纸篓的内容。清倒废纸篓即可收回空间。";
"AI models you downloaded. Remove ones you no longer use with the tool that downloaded them." = "你下载的 AI 模型。请用下载它们的工具移除不再使用的模型。";
"Your own files. RoomyDisk never removes this folder; look inside it for big things you no longer need." = "你自己的文件。RoomyDisk 从不移除此文件夹；可在其中找出不再需要的大文件。";
"macOS itself. It is protected and cannot be changed." = "macOS 本身。它受保护，无法更改。";
"Files macOS and apps installed for every user, such as fonts, drivers and plug-ins. Changes here need an administrator." = "macOS 和 App 为所有用户安装的文件，例如字体、驱动和插件。在此更改需要管理员权限。";
"Your apps. Remove an app with the Uninstaller so its files go with it." = "你的 App。请用卸载器移除 App，以便一并移除其文件。";
"Memory macOS moves to disk and the sleep image. macOS manages it." = "macOS 移到磁盘的内存和睡眠映像。由 macOS 管理。";
"Temporary files and caches of macOS, one folder per user. macOS cleans it itself; don't remove it by hand." = "macOS 的临时文件和缓存，每个用户一个文件夹。macOS 会自行清理；请勿手动移除。";
"The home folders of everyone who uses this Mac." = "使用这台 Mac 的所有人的个人文件夹。";
"Homebrew and the tools you installed with it. Run brew cleanup to remove old versions." = "Homebrew 及你用它安装的工具。运行 brew cleanup 可移除旧版本。";
"Apple's command line tools: git, compilers and more. Removing them breaks those tools." = "Apple 的命令行工具：git、编译器等。移除会导致这些工具无法使用。";
"Packages a JavaScript project downloaded. Run npm install to get them back." = "JavaScript 项目下载的包。运行 npm install 即可恢复。";
"The history of a Git repository. Removing it loses every earlier version of the project." = "Git 仓库的历史记录。移除会丢失项目的所有早期版本。";
"Build products of a project. They come back on the next build." = "项目的构建产物。下次构建时会重新生成。";
"Libraries CocoaPods downloaded for a project. Run pod install to get them back." = "CocoaPods 为项目下载的库。运行 pod install 即可恢复。";
"Compiled Python files. Python makes them again." = "编译后的 Python 文件。Python 会重新生成。";
"A Python virtual environment with its packages. Make it again from the project's requirements." = "带有软件包的 Python 虚拟环境。可根据项目的依赖重新创建。";
"Finder's notes on how to show a folder. Finder makes it again." = "访达记录的文件夹显示方式。访达会重新生成。";
"An installer. Once the app is installed you don't need it any more." = "安装器。App 安装后就不再需要它。";
"A disk image. It may be an installer you no longer need, or a disk image of your own; open it to check." = "磁盘映像。可能是不再需要的安装器，也可能是你自己的磁盘映像；请打开确认。";
"A copy of iPhone or iPad software that Finder downloaded. Finder downloads it again when needed." = "访达下载的 iPhone 或 iPad 软件。需要时访达会重新下载。";
"An app. Remove it with the Uninstaller so the files it left go with it." = "一个 App。请用卸载器移除，以便一并移除它留下的文件。";
"Caches of macOS and apps for all users. macOS manages them." = "macOS 和 App 面向所有用户的缓存。由 macOS 管理。";
"Logs macOS writes. macOS removes old ones itself." = "macOS 写入的日志。macOS 会自行移除旧日志。";
"Things you downloaded. Old installers and archives here can often go; Space Hunters lists old downloads." = "你下载的内容。这里的旧安装器和压缩文件通常可以移除；Space Hunters 会列出旧下载。";
"The Android SDK and emulators. Android Studio can download parts again, but you would have to set them up." = "Android SDK 和模拟器。Android Studio 可以重新下载部分内容，但你需要重新设置。";
"Go modules downloaded for your projects. Go downloads them again." = "为你的项目下载的 Go 模块。Go 会重新下载。";
"Slack's data: sign-in, settings and messages kept offline. Removing it signs you out." = "Slack 的数据：登录信息、设置和离线保存的消息。移除后会退出登录。";
"Your Music library with songs and podcasts. Remove items in the Music app instead." = "包含歌曲和播客的音乐资料库。请在“音乐”App 中移除项目。";
"No junk found." = "未发现垃圾文件。";
"%@ of junk can be moved to the Trash. Items: %lld." = "可将 %@ 的垃圾文件移到废纸篓。项目数：%lld。";
"Moved to the Trash: %lld. Freed: %@." = "已移到废纸篓：%lld。已释放：%@。";
"Move %@ of caches, logs and other junk (%lld items) to the Trash?" = "要将 %@ 的缓存、日志和其他垃圾文件（%lld 个项目）移到废纸篓吗？";
"Scan Folder" = "扫描文件夹";
"Measures a folder and lists the items that take the most space." = "测量文件夹并列出占用空间最多的项目。";
"Folder" = "文件夹";
"Number of Items" = "项目数";
"Get Free Space" = "获取可用空间";
"Tells how much space is free on the startup disk." = "告诉你启动磁盘上有多少可用空间。";
"Find Junk" = "查找垃圾文件";
"Measures the caches, logs and other junk Smart Clean can move to the Trash. Nothing is moved." = "测量智能清理可移到废纸篓的缓存、日志和其他垃圾文件。不会移动任何内容。";
"Clean Junk" = "清理垃圾文件";
"Moves the caches, logs and other junk Smart Clean ticks by itself to the Trash, after you confirm. Nothing is deleted; Put Back works." = "在你确认后，将智能清理自动勾选的缓存、日志和其他垃圾文件移到废纸篓。不会删除任何内容；可以放回原处。";
"Choose a folder on this Mac." = "请选择这台 Mac 上的文件夹。";
"macOS did not say how much space is free." = "macOS 未告知可用空间。";
